  <text>
    <body>
      <p><hi rend="italic">Sands &amp; McDougall's directory of Victoria, 1935</hi>. 2,236 pages.</p>
      <p>State Library Victoria has digitised this directory, and you can <ref target="https://viewer.slv.vic.gov.au/?entity=IE14054304&amp;mode=browse">read it online</ref>.</p>
      <p>The listings here come from the 1935 directory's Carlton section, pp. 191–200.</p>
      <p>The project covers the area south of Grattan Street, west of Swanston Street, east of Elizabeth Street and north of Victoria Street.</p>
    </body>
